a Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google Vids集成Gemini Omni模型并上线数字分身定制功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic利用Claude实现大规模代码迁移，两周完成百万行代码转换</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">1Password集成Claude AI助手，实现安全授权下的自动化登录与凭证填充</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面发布2.8万亿参数开源模型Kimi K3，支持100万词元上下文</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面于7月16日正式发布新一代开源大模型Kimi K3，其参数规模高达2.8万亿，成为目前全球参数最大的开源模型。该模型原生支持视觉理解，并具备100万词元的超长上下文窗口，旨在提升软件工程、深度研究及多模态理解等复杂任务的处理效率。Kimi K3通过将长程代码工程与多模态分析整合，显著增强了模型在复杂场景下的综合处理能力。此次发布标志着开源阵营在模型体量上首次实现对闭源巨头的超越。行业分析指出，随着国产大模型在技术参数与商业化落地上的提速，国内厂商正通过高性价比策略稳固市场地位，并进一步推动国产替代逻辑的深化。该模型的推出不仅刷新了开源大模型的技术天花板，也为国产AI产业的景气度注入了新动能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱AI年度经常性收入达10亿美元，5个月内实现15倍增长</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/08095df0080d5245682d49cca57ad19c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">截至2026年7月，智谱年度经常性收入（ARR）已达到10亿美元规模，在今年1月至7月期间实现约15倍增长。智谱的快速商业化主要得益于其在AI Coding领域的战略布局，通过以两个月一版的节奏迭代模型，并于2026年6月发布强化代码能力的GLM-5.2模型。尽管今年第一季度GLM API价格累计提升约83%，但其调用量仍保持约400%的增长。智谱创始人唐杰认为，Coding能力是AI Agent协同发展的核心。目前，AI Coding与视频生成已成为生成式AI领域商业化增长最快的方向。面对MiniMax M3、月之暗面K3以及OpenAI GPT-5.6等竞品的激烈竞争，智谱通过提升模型代码生成能力与Reasoning方向的研发，成功验证了AI Coding赛道的商业价值，并加速了国内大模型企业的商业化进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google Vids集成Gemini Omni模型并上线数字分身定制功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/775e755f55e215fe0cda16b276bfd264.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google Vids正式引入多模态模型Gemini Omni，并推出数字虚拟人定制功能。用户仅需上传自拍照片与语音录音，即可生成高度还原的专属数字分身，实现无需真人出镜的视频创作。Gemini Omni的加入使平台支持文字提示词与参考图结合生成视频，并提供背景替换、光线调整及特效添加等功能，同时支持渐进式编辑以提升创作效率。该功能旨在强化Google Vids在企业培训、内部通告等办公场景的应用能力。为确保安全合规，谷歌将数字分身与用户Google账户绑定，并强制使用SynthID技术添加隐形水印，防止虚假内容生成。目前，该功能仅面向特定地区年满18岁的用户开放。此次更新使Google Vids在AI视频创作领域直接对标HeyGen、Synthesia等初创公司。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic利用Claude实现大规模代码迁移，两周完成百万行代码转换</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0bc19e8d5c77782b01d62f0e2d95bcf9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日披露，其内部团队利用Claude Fable5、Opus4.8及动态工作流，成功将多个大规模代码库迁移至新编程语言。其中，Bun联合创始人Jarred Sumner利用Claude Code在两周内将百万行Zig代码迁移至Rust，CI测试链100%通过；Anthropic Labs负责人Mike Krieger则在一个周末内将16.5万行Python代码重构为TypeScript。该方案核心在于“优化生产代码的流程”而非单纯修补代码，通过构建多代理循环系统，实现从规则制定、依赖分析到自动化测试与修复的全流程闭环。在成本方面，Bun迁移消耗约59亿输入token与6.9亿输出token，API成本约16.5万美元。迁移后的系统性能显著提升，Bun的二进制启动速度提升6倍，内存占用大幅下降。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">1Password集成Claude AI助手，实现安全授权下的自动化登录与凭证填充</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9ea00fe62bd77a4d02423bda0f6ca999.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">1Password正式接入Claude AI助手，推出集成功能，允许AI在用户授权下自动填充登录信息与一次性验证码。该方案通过隔离机制确保密码明文不暴露给Claude，敏感数据不会进入AI上下文记忆或上传至Anthropic后台。用户需对每次访问请求进行确认，授权仅在单次任务中生效。此外，1Password浏览器扩展新增智能代理模式，为所有AI代理操作提供底层安全防护。目前该集成率先登陆Mac平台，面向1Password个人、家庭及企业版订阅用户开放，并要求用户持有Claude Pro、Max、Team或Enterprise订阅。运行环境需同时配置1Password桌面端及浏览器扩展，以及Claude桌面端与Claude in Chrome扩展。该功能目前仅支持登录凭证与验证码，暂不支持信用卡及身份信息。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
